Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> statement_list
Rule 1     statement -> NAME EQUALS expression SEMICOLON
Rule 2     expression -> STRING
Rule 3     expression -> LBRACKET list_items RBRACKET
Rule 4     list_items -> expression COMMA list_items
Rule 5     list_items -> expression
Rule 6     expression -> expression LBRACKET expression RBRACKET
Rule 7     empty -> <empty>
Rule 8     opt_expression -> expression
Rule 9     opt_expression -> empty
Rule 10    expression -> expression LBRACKET opt_expression COLON opt_expression RBRACKET
Rule 11    statement -> expression SEMICOLON
Rule 12    statement -> LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
Rule 13    block -> LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
Rule 14    expression -> READINT LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 15    statement -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN statement
Rule 16    statement -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN statement ELSE statement
Rule 17    statement -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN block
Rule 18    statement -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN block ELSE block
Rule 19    statement -> WHILE LPAREN expression RPAREN statement
Rule 20    statement_list -> statement statement_list
Rule 21    statement_list -> statement
Rule 22    statement -> PRINT LPAREN expression RPAREN SEMICOLON
Rule 23    expression -> expression LESSTHAN expression
Rule 24    expression -> expression GREATERTHAN expression
Rule 25    expression -> expression EQUALTO expression
Rule 26    expression -> expression OROR expression
Rule 27    expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 28    expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 29    expression -> expression TIMES expression
Rule 30    expression -> expression DIVIDE expression
Rule 31    expression -> expression EXP expression
Rule 32    expression -> MINUS expression
Rule 33    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 34    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 35    expression -> NAME

Terminals, with rules where they appear

COLON                : 10
COMMA                : 4
DIVIDE               : 30
ELSE                 : 16 18
EQUALS               : 1
EQUALTO              : 25
EXP                  : 31
GREATERTHAN          : 24
IF                   : 15 16 17 18
LBRACE               : 12 13
LBRACKET             : 3 6 10
LESSTHAN             : 23
LPAREN               : 14 15 16 17 18 19 22 33
MINUS                : 28 32
NAME                 : 1 35
NUMBER               : 34
OROR                 : 26
PLUS                 : 27
PRINT                : 22
RBRACE               : 12 13
RBRACKET             : 3 6 10
READINT              : 14
RPAREN               : 14 15 16 17 18 19 22 33
SEMICOLON            : 1 11 22
STRING               : 2
TIMES                : 29
WHILE                : 19
error                : 

